msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:74
msgid "``daemon_not_running``"
msgstr "``daemon_not_running``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:75
msgid "No daemon answers for the data directory shown."
msgstr "所示数据目录没有守护进程应答。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:76
msgid ""
"``anet up``. If a node runs under another identity, the message names the"
" command to use with ``--id``."
msgstr "运行 ``anet up``\\ 。如果节点以另一个身份运行,消息会指明应配合 ``--id`` 使用的命令。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:78
msgid "``identity_v02``"
msgstr "``identity_v02``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:79
msgid ""
"The data directory was written by anet 0.2. Version 0.3 does not migrate "
"old data."
msgstr "数据目录由 anet 0.2 写入。0.3 版不迁移旧数据。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:81
msgid ""
"Move the directory away and run ``anet up`` to create a new identity. See"
" :doc:`/upgrading`."
msgstr "将该目录移开,并运行 ``anet up`` 以创建新的身份。参见 :doc:`/upgrading`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:83
msgid "``datadir_too_new``"
msgstr "``datadir_too_new``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:84
msgid "The data directory was written by a newer release."
msgstr "数据目录由更新的版本写入。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:85
msgid "``anet update``. The directory is not deleted."
msgstr "运行 ``anet update``\\ 。该目录不会被删除。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:86
msgid "``clock_skew``"
msgstr "``clock_skew``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:87
msgid ""
"The clock of the machine differs from that of the hub by more than five "
"minutes."
msgstr "本机时钟与 hub 时钟相差超过五分钟。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:89
msgid ""
"Correct the system time, for example by enabling NTP, and repeat the "
"command."
msgstr "校正系统时间,例如启用 NTP,然后重复该命令。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:91
msgid "``config_invalid``"
msgstr "``config_invalid``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:92
msgid "A setting is not valid. The message names the key and the rule."
msgstr "某项设置无效。消息会指明键和规则。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:93
msgid "Correct the value in ``config.json`` or through the command that sets it."
msgstr "在 ``config.json`` 中,或通过设置该项的命令更正该值。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:95
msgid "``config_key_removed``, ``cli_removed``"
msgstr "``config_key_removed``\\ 、\\ ``cli_removed``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:96
msgid "A setting or a command of an earlier release was removed in 0.3.0."
msgstr "早期版本的某项设置或命令已在 0.3.0 中移除。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:97
msgid "The message names the replacement. See :doc:`/upgrading`."
msgstr "消息会指明替代方式。参见 :doc:`/upgrading`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:98
msgid "``aid_invalid``"
msgstr "``aid_invalid``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:99
msgid "The argument is not a full AID."
msgstr "参数不是完整的 AID。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:100
msgid ""
"Copy the full AID from the AID column of ``anet find`` or ``anet peers "
"list``."
msgstr "从 ``anet find`` 或 ``anet peers list`` 的 AID 列中复制完整的 AID。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:102
msgid "``tty_required``"
msgstr "``tty_required``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:103
msgid "The action requires confirmation at a terminal of the operator."
msgstr "该操作需要在运维人员的终端上确认。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:104
msgid ""
"Run the command shown in an interactive terminal. Commands that widen "
"authority are not available through MCP or the control plane."
msgstr "在交互式终端中运行所示命令。扩大权限的命令不能通过 MCP 或控制面使用。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:106
msgid "``retention_invalid``"
msgstr "``retention_invalid``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:107
msgid "A retention value does not have the form ``<days>d`` or ``forever``."
msgstr "保留期的取值不符合 ``<days>d`` 或 ``forever`` 的形式。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:108
msgid "``anet retention set 30d``. Valid values are 1 to 3650 days."
msgstr "运行 ``anet retention set 30d``\\ 。有效值为 1 到 3650 天。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:109
msgid "``daemon_running``"
msgstr "``daemon_running``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:110
msgid ""
"The command changes files of the data directory, and the daemon holds it."
" ``anet init --without`` and ``anet init --with`` work only while the "
"daemon is stopped."
msgstr ""
"命令要修改数据目录中的文件，而守护进程持有该目录。``anet init --without`` 与 ``anet init --with`` "
"只能在守护进程停止时使用。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:113
msgid "``anet down``, repeat the command, then ``anet up``."
msgstr "``anet down``，重复该命令，然后 ``anet up``。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:114
msgid "``daemon_not_answering``"
msgstr "``daemon_not_answering``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:115
msgid ""
"A daemon holds the data directory but does not answer within a few "
"seconds. The command changed nothing."
msgstr "有守护进程持有数据目录，但在数秒内没有应答。命令没有做任何改动。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:117
msgid "Try again later. If the daemon stays silent, ``anet logs``."
msgstr "稍后再试。若守护进程持续无应答，查看 ``anet logs``。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:118
msgid "``local_write_failed``"
msgstr "``local_write_failed``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:119
msgid "The node could not write a change to the data directory."
msgstr "节点没能把改动写进数据目录。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:120
msgid ""
"Check the free space and the permissions of the data directory, and "
"repeat the command."
msgstr "检查数据目录的剩余空间和权限，然后重复该命令。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:122
msgid "``no_local_task``"
msgstr "``no_local_task``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:123
msgid ""
"The node holds no task of that identifier. The task ended and its content"
" was deleted after the retention period, or the data of the node is older"
" than the task."
msgstr "节点上没有该标识的任务。任务已结束且其内容已在保存期之后被删除，或节点的数据比该任务旧。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:126
msgid "``anet audit --interaction <id>`` shows the evidence that remains."
msgstr "``anet audit --interaction <id>`` 显示仍保留的证据。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:127
msgid "``module_absent``, ``module_absent.configured``"
msgstr "``module_absent``, ``module_absent.configured``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:128
msgid ""
"The function belongs to a module that is not part of this build, or that "
"``without`` turns off. At the start, a configuration block of such a "
"module stops the daemon with ``module_absent.configured``."
msgstr ""
"该功能属于一个不在此构建中、或被 ``without`` 关闭的模块。启动时，这类模块的配置块会使守护进程以 "
"``module_absent.configured`` 停止。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:131
msgid ""
"The sentence names the cause and the remedy: install the default build, "
"or ``anet down``, ``anet init --with <module>`` and ``anet up``, or "
"remove the configuration block. ``anet version`` lists the modules in the"
" binary."
msgstr ""
"句子会写明原因和补救办法：安装默认构建，或依次 ``anet down``、``anet init --with <module>`` 与 "
"``anet up``，或删除配置块。``anet version`` 列出二进制中的模块。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:134
msgid "``module_absent.payment``"
msgstr "``module_absent.payment``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:135
msgid ""
"A quote arrived, and this node has no payment module. Nothing was signed."
" The task waits in ``input-required``."
msgstr "收到了报价，而本节点没有付款模块。没有签署任何东西。任务停在 ``input-required``。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:137
msgid ""
"Install a build with payment and run ``anet pay <task>``, or cancel the "
"task with ``anet task cancel <task>``."
msgstr "安装带付款的构建并运行 ``anet pay <task>``，或用 ``anet task cancel <task>`` 取消任务。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:139
msgid "``without_configured``"
msgstr "``without_configured``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:140
msgid ""
"``anet init --without`` was refused because ``config.json`` already holds"
" the configuration of that module."
msgstr "``anet init --without`` 被拒绝，因为 ``config.json`` 中已有该模块的配置。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:142
msgid "Remove the configuration block, then repeat the command."
msgstr "删除该配置块，然后重复该命令。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:143
msgid "``build_tag_pending``"
msgstr "``build_tag_pending``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:144
msgid ""
"``build.sh --without`` names a module that has no build tag in this "
"version (the console). Nothing was built."
msgstr "``build.sh --without`` 指定的模块在此版本中没有构建标签（控制台）。没有构建任何东西。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:146
msgid "Turn the module off in the configuration with ``anet init --without``."
msgstr "改用 ``anet init --without`` 在配置中关闭该模块。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:147
msgid "``update_variant_unknown``, ``update_variant_unknown.mismatch``"
msgstr "``update_variant_unknown``, ``update_variant_unknown.mismatch``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:148
msgid ""
"``anet update`` found a binary that was built locally, or a binary whose "
"set of modules differs from the released build of its variant. Nothing "
"was downloaded."
msgstr "``anet update`` 发现本地构建的二进制，或模块组合与其变体的发布构建不同的二进制。没有下载任何东西。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:151
msgid ""
"Build again in the same way, or install a released build with "
"``install.sh``."
msgstr "按原来的方式重新构建，或用 ``install.sh`` 安装发布构建。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:154
msgid ""
"The clock matters in a second respect: when the clock cannot be compared "
"with the hub, deletion of expired keys and content is slowed to avoid "
"deleting early. The status lines ``clock.skewed``, ``clock.unverified`` "
"and ``clock.no_hub`` describe the state."
msgstr ""
"时钟在另一方面也很重要:当时钟无法与 hub 比对时,过期密钥和内容的删除会放慢,以避免过早删除。状态行 ``clock.skewed``\\ "
"、\\ ``clock.unverified`` 和 ``clock.no_hub`` 描述这些状态。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:161
msgid "Joining a hub"
msgstr "加入 hub"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:163
msgid ""
"A node that is not registered at a hub cannot send or receive. The "
"command ``anet hub-register <url>`` starts the join. A hub that admits by"
" AID prints one line of the form ``anet-hub admit <aid>``; that line is "
"sent to the operator of the hub, and joining then finishes on its own."
msgstr ""
"未在 hub 注册的节点无法发送或接收。命令 ``anet hub-register <url>`` 开始加入流程。按 AID 准入的 hub "
"会输出一行形如 ``anet-hub admit <aid>`` 的内容;将这一行发送给 hub 的运营方,加入流程随后会自行完成。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:179
msgid "``no_hub_yet``"
msgstr "``no_hub_yet``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:180
msgid "The node has not joined a hub."
msgstr "节点尚未加入 hub。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:181
msgid "``anet hub-register <hub-url>``."
msgstr "运行 ``anet hub-register <hub-url>``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:182
msgid "``hub_pending_admission``"
msgstr "``hub_pending_admission``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:183
msgid "The hub requires its operator to admit the AID first."
msgstr "hub 要求其运营方先准入该 AID。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:184
msgid ""
"Send the printed ``anet-hub admit <aid>`` line to the operator of the "
"hub. No further action is needed afterwards. Do not register again."
msgstr "将输出的 ``anet-hub admit <aid>`` 行发送给 hub 的运营方。此后无需其他操作。请勿再次注册。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:186
msgid "``hub_retrying``"
msgstr "``hub_retrying``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:187
msgid ""
"Joining could not be completed yet. The message gives the reason and the "
"time of the next attempt."
msgstr "加入流程暂时无法完成。消息会给出原因和下次尝试的时间。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:189
msgid "None; the node retries."
msgstr "无;节点会重试。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:190
msgid "``hub_retrying.quota``"
msgstr "``hub_retrying.quota``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:191
msgid "The sign-ups of the network of the node for the current day are used up."
msgstr "节点所在网络当日的注册名额已用完。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:193
msgid ""
"Wait for the next attempt, or ask the operator of the hub to admit the "
"AID."
msgstr "等待下一次尝试,或请 hub 运营方准入该 AID。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:195
msgid "``hub_refused``"
msgstr "``hub_refused``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:196
msgid "The hub refused the registration. The node does not retry."
msgstr "hub 拒绝了注册。节点不会重试。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:197
msgid "Contact the operator of the hub with the message."
msgstr "携带该消息联系 hub 的运营方。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:198
msgid "``hub_unreachable``"
msgstr "``hub_unreachable``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:199
msgid "The hub does not answer. Nothing was changed."
msgstr "hub 没有应答。未作任何更改。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:200
msgid ""
"Check the address and the network, then repeat ``anet hub-register <hub-"
"url>``."
msgstr "检查地址和网络,然后重复 ``anet hub-register <hub-url>``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:202
msgid "``hub_publication_blocked``"
msgstr "``hub_publication_blocked``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:203
msgid ""
"The registration data contain content that an organization module marks "
"as confidential, so it was not sent."
msgstr "注册数据包含被组织模块标记为机密的内容,因此未发送。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:205
msgid ""
"Remove the content from the agent name, the capability descriptions or "
"the profile and register again."
