"by the hub does not agree with the ledger or with the proofs it signed. "
"The evidence is saved with ``anet audit-hub --json`` and sent to the "
"operator of the hub."
msgstr ""
"对于 hub 账本的审计,代码 ``balance_mismatch``\\ 、\\ ``omitted_from_ledger``\\ 、\\ "
