"``proof_expired`` 由 ``anet doctor`` 和 ``anet audit-hub`` 报告。它们表明 hub "
"报告的余额与账本或其签名的证明不一致。请用 ``anet audit-hub --json`` 保存证据,并发送给 hub 的运营方。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:542
msgid "Identity and keys"
msgstr "身份与密钥"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:551
msgid "``identity_stopped``"
msgstr "``identity_stopped``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:552
msgid ""
"The identity was recovered or rotated on another machine, so this node "
"stopped."
msgstr "该身份已在另一台机器上恢复或轮换,因此本节点已停止。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:554
msgid ""
"If this was intended, remove the copy with ``anet identity rm <name> "
"--purge``. If not, the recovery passphrase may have leaked: create a new "
"identity and inform the contacts."
msgstr ""
"如果这是预期的操作,请用 ``anet identity rm <name> --purge`` "
"删除该副本。否则恢复口令可能已经泄露:请创建新的身份并通知联系人。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:557
msgid "``identity_deactivated``"
msgstr "``identity_deactivated``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:558
msgid "The identity was deactivated and cannot send or receive."
msgstr "该身份已被停用,无法发送或接收。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:559
msgid "``anet id new <name>`` creates a new identity."
msgstr "运行 ``anet id new <name>`` 创建新的身份。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:560
msgid "``local_state_lost``"
msgstr "``local_state_lost``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:561
msgid ""
"The data of the node are older than the last state of the identity at the"
" hub. Tasks in progress were ended."
msgstr "节点的数据早于该身份在 hub 上的最后状态。进行中的任务已被结束。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:563
msgid ""
"If a backup was restored or the data directory was copied, start the "
"tasks again. Otherwise another copy of the identity is running: ``anet "
"identity rotate --emergency``."
msgstr ""
"如果恢复过备份或复制过数据目录,请重新启动这些任务。否则说明该身份的另一份副本正在运行:运行 ``anet identity rotate "
"--emergency``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:566
msgid "``local_state_lost.peer``"
msgstr "``local_state_lost.peer``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:567
msgid "The data of the other node went back to an older state."
msgstr "对方节点的数据回退到了较旧的状态。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:568
msgid "Start the task again if it is still needed."
msgstr "如果仍需要该任务,重新启动它。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:569
msgid "``key_compromise``, ``key_compromise.peer``"
msgstr "``key_compromise``\\ 、\\ ``key_compromise.peer``"

