msgid "A node performed an emergency rotation and ended the tasks in progress."
msgstr "某个节点执行了紧急轮换,并结束了进行中的任务。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:571
msgid "Start the tasks again. The new keys are used."
msgstr "重新启动这些任务。将使用新的密钥。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:572
msgid "``key_state.approve``"
msgstr "``key_state.approve``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:573
msgid ""
"The other side performed an emergency rotation before the operator "
"approved its task, so the task may not originate from it. It was refused."
msgstr "对方在运营人员批准其任务之前执行了紧急轮换,因此该任务可能并非来自对方。该任务已被拒绝。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:577
msgid "``witness_unreachable``"
msgstr "``witness_unreachable``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:578
msgid "The witness hub cannot be reached; a scheduled rotation needs it."
msgstr "无法连接见证 hub;计划内的轮换需要它。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:579
msgid ""
"Try again later. If a key has leaked, ``anet identity rotate "
"--emergency``."
msgstr "稍后再试。如果密钥已经泄露,运行 ``anet identity rotate --emergency``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:580
msgid ""
"``recovery_file_missing``, ``recovery_file_unprotected``, "
"``recovery_passphrase_wrong``, ``recovery_wrong_identity``, "
"``recovery_mismatch``"
msgstr ""
"``recovery_file_missing``\\ 、\\ ``recovery_file_unprotected``\\ 、\\ "
"``recovery_passphrase_wrong``\\ 、\\ ``recovery_wrong_identity``\\ 、\\ "
"``recovery_mismatch``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:583
msgid ""
"The recovery file or the passphrase does not fit the identity, or the "
"file is out of date."
msgstr "恢复文件或口令与该身份不符,或文件已过期。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:585
msgid ""
"Pass the most recent copy with ``--recovery-file``. A file without a "
"passphrase works only with its own data directory; run ``anet identity "
"protect`` first."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``--recovery-file`` 传入最新的副本。没有口令的文件只能与其自身的数据目录配合使用;请先运行 ``anet "
"identity protect``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:588
msgid "``passphrase_too_short``"
msgstr "``passphrase_too_short``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:589
msgid "A recovery passphrase needs at least 12 characters."
msgstr "恢复口令至少需要 12 个字符。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:590
msgid "Choose a longer one."
msgstr "请选择更长的口令。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:591
msgid "``recover_target_exists``, ``recover_not_witness``"
msgstr "``recover_target_exists``\\ 、\\ ``recover_not_witness``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:592
msgid ""
"A local identity with that name exists, or the hub given is not the "
"witness hub of the identity."
msgstr "已存在同名的本地身份,或所给的 hub 不是该身份的见证 hub。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:594
msgid "Add ``--name <new-name>`` or ``--hub <witness-hub-url>``."
msgstr "添加 ``--name <new-name>`` 或 ``--hub <witness-hub-url>``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:596
msgid ""
"The status lines ``identity.unprotected`` and "
"``identity.unprotected.resume`` say that no recovery passphrase is set, "
"or that setting it was interrupted. ``anet identity protect`` at a "
"terminal completes the step."
msgstr ""
"状态行 ``identity.unprotected`` 和 ``identity.unprotected.resume`` "
"表示尚未设置恢复口令,或设置过程被中断。在终端中运行 ``anet identity protect`` 可完成这一步。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:600
msgid ""
"After an emergency rotation the control token and the local A2A token of "
"the node are replaced. Coding tools that were wired earlier are to be "
"restarted, and ``anet agents wire --all`` is run again so that clients of"
" the local A2A interface receive the new token (see :ref:`howto-coding-"
"agents-hermes-a2a`). Model API keys are replaced with each provider."
msgstr ""
"紧急轮换之后,节点的控制令牌和本地 A2A 令牌都会被替换。先前已接入的编码工具须重启,并再次运行 ``anet agents wire "
"--all``,使本地 A2A 接口的客户端获得新令牌(参见 :ref:`howto-coding-agents-hermes-a2a`)。模型 "
"API 密钥须在各提供方处更换。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:608
msgid "Sandbox and automatic replies"
msgstr "沙箱与自动回复"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:610
msgid ""
"Tasks of untrusted peers run in a sandbox when automatic replies are "
"enabled. The sandbox is described in :ref:`topics-sandbox`. ``anet "
"doctor`` runs a self-check of the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"启用自动回复时,不受信任的对等方的任务在沙箱中运行。沙箱的说明见 :ref:`topics-sandbox`\\ 。\\ ``anet "
"doctor`` 会对沙箱执行自检。"

