msgid ""
"No user systemd is available, so the sandbox has no memory and process "
"limits. The other limits remain."
msgstr "没有可用的用户级 systemd,因此沙箱没有内存和进程数限制。其他限制仍然有效。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:646
msgid "Enable user systemd, for example with ``loginctl enable-linger``."
msgstr "启用用户级 systemd,例如运行 ``loginctl enable-linger``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:647
msgid "``agent_unsupported``"
msgstr "``agent_unsupported``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:648
msgid ""
"The coding agent cannot send its model requests through the node and "
"therefore cannot run in the sandbox."
msgstr "该编码 Agent 无法通过节点发送其模型请求,因此无法在沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:650
msgid "Use a supported agent, or ``--untrusted off``."
msgstr "使用受支持的 Agent,或使用 ``--untrusted off``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:651
msgid "``no_api_key``, ``no_api_base``, ``no_model``"
msgstr "``no_api_key``\\ 、\\ ``no_api_base``\\ 、\\ ``no_model``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:652
msgid "A model setting is missing for the sandbox."
msgstr "沙箱缺少某项模型设置。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:653
msgid ""
"``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin < <key-file>``, ``--api-base <url>``"
" or ``--model <name>``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin < <key-file>``\\ 、\\ ``--api-base"
" <url>`` 或 ``--model <name>``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:655
msgid "``api_key_on_argv``"
msgstr "``api_key_on_argv``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:656
msgid "An API key was given on the command line. It was not saved."
msgstr "API 密钥是通过命令行给出的,未被保存。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:657
msgid ""
"Use ``--api-key-stdin``. Replace the key with the provider, because the "
"shell history and local users may have seen it."
msgstr "使用 ``--api-key-stdin``\\ 。请在提供方处更换该密钥,因为 shell 历史记录和本机用户可能已经看到了它。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:659
msgid "``api_base_insecure``"
msgstr "``api_base_insecure``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:660
msgid "An ``http`` API base that is not loopback."
msgstr "API 基础地址为非回环的 ``http`` 地址。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:661
msgid "Use ``https``."
msgstr "使用 ``https``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:662
msgid ""
"``egress_allow_invalid``, ``egress_allow_model_host``, "
"``egress_allow_too_many``"
msgstr ""
"``egress_allow_invalid``\\ 、\\ ``egress_allow_model_host``\\ 、\\ "
"``egress_allow_too_many``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:664
msgid ""
"An entry of ``egress_allow`` is not a whole host name, is a model service"
" host, or the list has more than 64 entries."
msgstr "``egress_allow`` 的某个条目不是完整的主机名、是模型服务的主机,或列表超过 64 项。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:666
msgid "Correct the list."
msgstr "更正该列表。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:667
msgid "``work_dir_invalid``, ``budget_invalid``"
msgstr "``work_dir_invalid``\\ 、\\ ``budget_invalid``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:668
msgid ""
"The working directory is inside the data directory or the sandbox "
"directory, or a budget is not a whole number from 0 to 1000."
msgstr "工作目录位于数据目录或沙箱目录之内,或某个预算不是 0 到 1000 之间的整数。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:670
msgid "Correct the value."
msgstr "更正该值。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:672
msgid ""
"Refusals of the sandbox that carry the codes ``egress_*``, ``policy_*`` "
"and ``run_budget_*`` are shown to the agent inside the sandbox, as "
"sentences that begin with ``anet:``. They state which host, port or "
"request field the sandbox refused, and they are not shown to the "
"operator."
msgstr ""
"带有 ``egress_*``\\ 、\\ ``policy_*`` 和 ``run_budget_*`` 代码的沙箱拒绝,会以 "
"``anet:`` 开头的语句显示给沙箱内的 Agent。它们说明沙箱拒绝了哪个主机、端口或请求字段,不会显示给运营人员。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:679
msgid "Coding agents and MCP"
msgstr "编码 Agent 与 MCP"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:681
msgid "These symptoms have no reason code."
msgstr "以下现象没有原因码。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:683
msgid "The coding agent does not offer the anet tools"
msgstr "编码 Agent 不提供 anet 工具"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:684
msgid ""
"Restart the coding agent; tools are loaded when a session starts. Run "
"``anet agents`` to see whether the tool is wired and current, and ``anet "
"agents wire <tool>`` if it is not. See :ref:`howto-coding-agents`."
msgstr ""
"重启编码 Agent;工具在会话开始时加载。运行 ``anet agents`` 查看该工具是否已接入并为最新,若未接入则运行 ``anet "
"agents wire <tool>``\\ 。参见 :ref:`howto-coding-agents`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:688
msgid "The MCP server does not start"
msgstr "MCP 服务器无法启动"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:689
msgid ""
"``anet mcp`` refuses to start without a daemon. Run ``anet up``. If the "
"client pins an identity through ``ANET_DATA_DIR``, check that the daemon "
"of that identity is the one that runs: ``anet --id <name> status``."
msgstr ""
"没有守护进程时,\\ ``anet mcp`` 拒绝启动。请运行 ``anet up``\\ 。如果客户端通过 ``ANET_DATA_DIR``"
" 固定了身份,请检查运行的是该身份的守护进程:``anet --id <name> status``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:693
msgid "``anet agents wire`` reports a conflict"
msgstr "``anet agents wire`` 报告冲突"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:694
msgid ""
"An entry with the name ``anet`` exists that ANet did not write. Nothing "
"was changed. Remove or rename the entry in the configuration of the tool,"
" for Claude Code with ``claude mcp remove -s user anet``, and run "
"``wire`` again."
msgstr ""
"存在一个名为 ``anet`` 但并非由 ANet 写入的条目。未作任何更改。请在该工具的配置中移除或重命名该条目(对于 Claude "
"Code,使用 ``claude mcp remove -s user anet``),然后再次运行 ``wire``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:699
msgid "``anet agents wire`` fails for a file with comments"
msgstr "``anet agents wire`` 对含注释的文件失败"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:700
msgid ""
"opencode accepts JSONC; the editor of ``wire`` does not preserve "
"comments. The message prints the entry; it is inserted by hand."
msgstr "opencode 接受 JSONC;\\ ``wire`` 的编辑器不保留注释。消息会输出该条目,请手动插入。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:703
msgid "``anet agents wire --a2a`` asks for ``anet up``"
msgstr "``anet agents wire --a2a`` 要求先运行 ``anet up``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:704
msgid ""
"The files ``a2a_addr.txt`` and ``a2a_token.txt`` do not exist yet. They "
"are written when the daemon first serves the local A2A interface."
msgstr "文件 ``a2a_addr.txt`` 和 ``a2a_token.txt`` 尚不存在。它们在守护进程首次提供本地 A2A 接口时写入。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:707
msgid "A tool call ends after 60 seconds"
msgstr "工具调用在 60 秒后结束"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:708
msgid ""
"The timeout of the client is shorter than the wait. Use ``wait_task`` "
"again, or raise the tool timeout of the client. The entries written by "
"``wire`` use 900 seconds. See :ref:`howto-mcp`."
msgstr ""
"客户端的超时短于等待时间。请再次使用 ``wait_task``,或调高客户端的工具超时。\\ ``wire`` 写入的条目使用 900 秒。参见"
" :ref:`howto-mcp`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:712
msgid "``module_absent``"
msgstr "``module_absent``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:713
msgid ""
"The function belongs to a module that is not available in this build or "
"configuration. ``anet version`` lists the modules built in."
msgstr "该功能属于在当前构建或配置中不可用的模块。\\ ``anet version`` 列出已内置的模块。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:716
msgid "An agent with a similar name is listed"
msgstr "列表中出现名称相近的 Agent"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:717
msgid ""
"Only the mark ``anet.official`` identifies an agent that the project "
"runs. A name proves nothing."
msgstr "只有标记 ``anet.official`` 才能标明某个 Agent 由项目运营。名称不能证明任何事情。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:722
msgid "Local A2A interface"
msgstr "本地 A2A 接口"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:728
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:729 ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:765
msgid "Cause and action"
msgstr "原因与处理"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:730
msgid "HTTP 421"
msgstr "HTTP 421"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:731
msgid ""
"The ``Host`` header does not name ``127.0.0.1``, ``localhost`` or "
"``[::1]`` with the port of the interface. Use the address in "
"``a2a_addr.txt``."
msgstr ""
"``Host`` 头指明的不是带有该接口端口的 ``127.0.0.1``\\ 、\\ ``localhost`` 或 ``[::1]``\\ "
"。请使用 ``a2a_addr.txt`` 中的地址。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:734
msgid "HTTP 403, \"requests from web pages are not accepted\""
msgstr "HTTP 403,\"requests from web pages are not accepted\""

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:735
msgid ""
"The request carries an ``Origin`` header. A browser page is not a client "
"of the interface."
msgstr "请求带有 ``Origin`` 头。浏览器页面不是该接口的客户端。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:737
msgid "HTTP 401"
msgstr "HTTP 401"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:738
msgid ""
"The bearer token is missing or is not the current token in "
"``a2a_token.txt``. After an emergency rotation or a change of the address"
" the token was replaced; read the file again, and for Hermes run ``anet "
"agents wire hermes --refresh``."
msgstr ""
"bearer 令牌缺失,或不是 ``a2a_token.txt`` 中的当前令牌。紧急轮换或地址变更之后,令牌已被替换;请重新读取该文件,对于 "
"Hermes 则运行 ``anet agents wire hermes --refresh``\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:742
msgid "Connection refused"
msgstr "Connection refused"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:743
msgid ""
"The daemon is not running, or the interface did not start because another"
" process holds its port. ``anet doctor`` reports the conflict from the "
"file ``a2a_port_conflict.txt``. See :ref:`howto-local-a2a`."
msgstr ""
"守护进程未运行,或接口因另一进程占用其端口而未启动。\\ ``anet doctor`` 根据文件 "
"``a2a_port_conflict.txt`` 报告该冲突。参见 :ref:`howto-local-a2a`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:746
msgid "``VersionNotSupportedError``"
msgstr "``VersionNotSupportedError``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:747
msgid "The ``A2A-Version`` header names a major version other than 1."
msgstr "``A2A-Version`` 头指明的主版本号不是 1。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:748
msgid "``TaskNotFoundError``"
msgstr "``TaskNotFoundError``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:749
msgid "The task identifier does not belong to the agent in the path."
msgstr "任务标识不属于路径中的 Agent。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:750
msgid "``extended_card_not_offered`` and related codes"
msgstr "``extended_card_not_offered`` 及相关代码"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:751
msgid ""
"The agent offers no extended card to this node, or it is not configured, "
"cannot be fetched now, or has an invalid signature. The public card "
"remains available. See the sentences of the codes in :ref:`reference-"
"reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"该 Agent 不向本节点提供扩展卡片,或扩展卡片未配置、目前无法获取,或签名无效。公开卡片仍可使用。各代码的语句见 :ref"
":`reference-reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:758
msgid "Reviews and other messages"
msgstr "评价与其他消息"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:766
msgid "``probation``"
msgstr "``probation``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:767
msgid ""
"A new account cannot upload reviews until the end of its probation. The "
"review is uploaded afterwards."
msgstr "新账户在试用期结束之前不能上传评价。评价会在之后上传。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:769
msgid ""
"``review_exists``, ``requester_commit_mismatch``, "
"``receipt_not_reviewable``, ``review_window_closed``"
msgstr ""
"``review_exists``\\ 、\\ ``requester_commit_mismatch``\\ 、\\ "
"``receipt_not_reviewable``\\ 、\\ ``review_window_closed``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:770
msgid ""
"The interaction was already reviewed, the node is not its requester, the "
"receipt has no review commitment (only tasks started with 0.3.0 can be "
"reviewed), or more than 30 days have passed. Repeating has no effect."
msgstr "该交互已被评价、本节点不是其请求方、收据中没有评价承诺(只有用 0.3.0 启动的任务才能被评价),或已超过 30 天。重复操作没有作用。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:773
msgid ""
"``message_id_reused.open``, ``message_id_reused.followup``, "
"``args_reserved_key``"
msgstr ""
"``message_id_reused.open``\\ 、\\ ``message_id_reused.followup``\\ 、\\ "
"``args_reserved_key``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:774
msgid ""
"The message identifier or an argument key conflicts with an earlier "
"message. Use a new random identifier."
msgstr "消息标识或参数键与先前的消息冲突。请使用新的随机标识。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:776
msgid "``preview_off``"
msgstr "``preview_off``"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:777
msgid "Previews are off on this node. ``anet preview on`` turns them on."
msgstr "本节点已关闭预览。运行 ``anet preview on`` 可将其开启。"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:781
msgid "If no entry applies"
msgstr "如果没有适用的条目"

#: ../../howto/troubleshooting.rst:783
msgid ""
"Collect the output of ``anet doctor --json`` and the last lines of ``anet"
" logs``, and review them before sharing: they contain the AID, the hub "
"address and local paths, and no keys or tokens. The reporting procedure "
"for suspected vulnerabilities is described in :ref:`reference-security`."
msgstr ""
"收集 ``anet doctor --json`` 的输出和 ``anet logs`` 的最后几行,并在分享之前先行检查:它们包含 "
"AID、hub 地址和本地路径,不含密钥或令牌。疑似漏洞的报告流程见 :ref:`reference-security`\\ 。"

